(247, 128, 1, 'Good Morning,\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCould you please advise why we are no longer receiving the stuklijst?\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThis creates a challenge, as we have to “guess” which position corresponds to which article.\r\n\r\nOur employees do not have access to the TPD archive, so this situation is quite inconvenient. Is it possible to find this information somewhere in Sumatra? We mainly need the position number.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI spoke with Carlos, and he mentioned that someone is currently working on this issue. Could you please confirm?\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThank you in advance.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 07:42:07', 'Hasret vragen over mailtje'),
